            <ArticleTitle>Radiologic findings of a traumatic urethral diverticulum with stones in an infertile male patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>158-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4261/1305-3825.DIR.2737-09.2</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Urethral diverticulum is rarely encountered in male patients. Although postmicturition dribble, pain and infection are usually present, infertility is rarely reported in urethral diverticulum. We present a case with urethral diverticulum associated with infertility, which was diagnosed radiologically.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
